# Opening new channel form for channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias> in project <projectAlias>
* ensuring project <projectAlias> exists in fixture for user <userAlias>
* navigating via sidebar to "chat"
* waiting for "[data-testid='create-new-channel']" to appear
