# Adding user <userAlias> to the open channel
* clicking on "[data-testid='channel-info-trigger']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='add-people-button']"
* typing stored user <userAlias> field "email" in "[data-testid='user-search-input']"
* clicking on stored user <userAlias> field "name" in "[data-testid='user-search-results']"
* clicking on "[data-testid='add-people-submit']"
* waiting for zero sync to settle fast
* clicking on "button[aria-label='Close channel info']" if visible
* waiting for "button[aria-label='Close channel info']" to disappear

